{
  "key": "letter-075-part-04",
  "number": 75,
  "generationId": "01a1e62b-3e36-706d-aefd-981f39725ffd",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "I do not swim, I just float.",
      "path": "audio/1970-75/31.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.223946
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "No one can ever do anything for another but if something happens to others out of what I am, that is something else, and there too I am not the doer.",
      "path": "audio/1970-75/32.mp3",
      "start": 3.434603,
      "end": 12.70102
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "As for the future - for me, the present is everything.",
      "path": "audio/1970-75/33.mp3",
      "start": 14.055079000000001,
      "end": 18.703447
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "And the past too is also a present - that has passed away.",
      "path": "audio/1970-75/34.mp3",
      "start": 20.097188,
      "end": 24.203197
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "And the future too - that is a present that is yet to come.",
      "path": "audio/1970-75/35.mp3",
      "start": 25.552516999999998,
      "end": 29.746304000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Life is always here and now so I do not bother about past and future.",
      "path": "audio/1970-75/36.mp3",
      "start": 31.003583,
      "end": 35.555350999999995
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "And it is amazing that ever since I stopped worrying about them they have begun to worry about me!",
      "path": "audio/1970-75/37.mp3",
      "start": 36.911995000000005,
      "end": 42.197415
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "My regards to all there.",
      "path": "audio/1970-75/38.mp3",
      "start": 43.623673000000004,
      "end": 45.58
    }
  ]
}
